                <li><span class="tm-story-check-ic">✓</span><span>Heat, frost, and weather-resistant seal prevents future bubble blistering</span></li>
                <li><span class="tm-story-check-ic">✓</span><span>Non-drip formula stays where applied without running onto clean clear coats</span></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="tm-story-row reverse">
            <div class="tm-story-media">
              <span class="tm-story-badge">Targeted DIY Application</span>
              <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1032/4541/4771/files/spp_shopify20260902180016_8654814357e3b373fc8c3a7868268847_cea423ef-e39d-4777-9330-87075eb0f5d1.jpg?v=1793736111" alt="Automotive Wheel and Edge Application" class="tm-story-img" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy">
