              <ul class="tm-story-checks">
                <li><span class="tm-story-check-ic">✓</span><span>Surface dries to touch in 1–2 hours; fully cures in 24 hours</span></li>
                <li><span class="tm-story-check-ic">✓</span><span>High-density foam applicator included for smooth, streak-free leveling</span></li>
                <li><span class="tm-story-check-ic">✓</span><span>Compatible with automotive primers, clear coats, and ceramic waxes</span></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tm-setup-band">
          <h3 class="tm-setup-title">3-Step Effortless Application</h3>
          <p class="tm-setup-sub">No complex sanding equipment or professional spray booths required.</p>
          <div class="tm-setup-grid">
            <div class="tm-setup-col">
              <div class="tm-setup-num">1</div>
              <h4 class="tm-setup-step-title">Clean &amp; Scrape</h4>
              <p class="tm-setup-step-desc">Remove loose flaking rust scale and wipe clean with a degreasing cloth.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tm-setup-col">
              <div class="tm-setup-num">2</div>
              <h4 class="tm-setup-step-title">Apply &amp; Spread</h4>
              <p class="tm-setup-step-desc">Dab paste onto foam sponge and spread an even layer across the repair area.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tm-setup-col">
              <div class="tm-setup-num">3</div>
              <h4 class="tm-setup-step-title">Cure &amp; Seal</h4>
              <p class="tm-setup-step-desc">Allow 24h cure; buff gently with microfiber towel for an airtight barrier.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

